{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那么今天就到这里。大家，明天也请加油喔！”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "mc0353", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“起立。”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5577", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“敬礼。”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室一口气热闹起来。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那个那个，考试还没有结束，请不要放松过头喔！”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "mc0354", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没问题的啦，老师。”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1148", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也对，大家都懂的吧。”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "mc0355", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“明天也还有考试，要是现在放松之后就惨了。呐，新吾也这么想吧？”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1149", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要玩就等考试都结束再玩就好。”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯、嗯，就是说啊。”", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "mc0356", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到老师连连点头，大多数的同学都露出“既然你都这么说了”的表情。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就在这时。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘明明自己就在跟妹妹玩。’", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……？”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "什么？", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我四处张望。", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是刚才的声音立刻混入教室的喧闹中……已经找不到是从哪里传来的了。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚才……是什么？", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是听错吧？", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉到仿佛墨汁渗出般的漆黑情绪。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……怎么了？”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1150", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没什么。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那大家就加油喔♪”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "万智", "alt_speaker_idx": 395, "voice": "mc0357", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "老师比平时脚步更轻快地离开了。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除此之外没有任何异状。", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就像平常放学后的教室。", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“新吾，你从刚才就在东张西望什么？”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1151", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有点事情。”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“做了什么心虚的事吗？”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2197", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不，不是。”", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不准回答得那么干脆，稍微犹豫一下啦！”", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2198", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘唔哇，好厚脸皮。’", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1152", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2199", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他们两人都露出吃到苦瓜般的表情。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……看来不是我听错。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呐，新吾──”", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1153", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哥哥。”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3440", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太正想说什么，樱乃刚好来到我们教室。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打扰了。”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3441", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃走向我们。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真快啊，樱乃那边结束了吗？”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3442", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有好几个人在看我们……大概是在看我跟樱乃。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然这不是什么罕见的事……", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……好像有点不一样？”", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不是？”", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3443", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃歪着头。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……如果樱乃没注意到，那就是我想太多了吧。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没什么。”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小樱乃，今天考得怎么样？”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1154", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还可以。”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3444", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊，那新吾呢？”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1155", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“还行吧。”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼，你也只有现在能说那种话了。”", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2200", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“公布结果后你就会说‘对不起出生在这世界上’。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2201", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我想应该不会说那种话啦。”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“给我不服输一点啊！”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2202", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有自信是好事，但是差不多就好了。”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5578", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为什么？”", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2203", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太大声会给人添麻烦。”", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5579", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……出生在这世界上对不起。”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2204", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪学姐先说了呢。”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3445", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么有干劲是很好。”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5580", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学怎么样呢？”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟平常一样。”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5580b", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这就是那种资优生的派头！”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“瓜生，不管你怎么努力都赢不过爱理的吧！”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪学姐在借用爱理的威风了。”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3446", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真是的……所谓考试，比起结果，自己学了什么才更重要吧？”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5581", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学看不下去地说。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理，那是考得好的人的理论喔。”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我觉得小乾也是考得好的那边的说。”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1156", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“为了追随美羽学姐，我可不能因为这种程度就倒下！”", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以我不才能输给什么瓜生。为了展示实力，我要赢，然后打倒你！”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2209", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我好像稍微理解小乾的思考模式了。”", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1157", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，说的也是。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "手段在不知不觉中变成了目的吧。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不好意思，今天我要先回去了。”", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 427, "voice": "ht1158", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我们也走吧。”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理也一起回家吧？”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3447", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是啊。”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5582", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“今天也要一起用功吗？”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3448", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会打扰你们？”", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5583", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打扰？”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3449", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你们两个人一起念书对吧？”", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5584", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。但是爱理老师在的话我会很高兴。”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3450", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我不是那个意思……”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5585", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我们决定考试期间要专心在这件事情上了。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是那样吗？”", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5586", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道了，不嫌弃的话我就陪你们一起用功吧。”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5587", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名同学愿意的话就太好了。”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁也要～安洁也想被叫去！这样下去会被赶出学校的～”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3599", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……糟糕到那种程度啊。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是的。与其说糟糕，用凄惨来形容感觉更贴切！”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3600", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道了。那我就好好指导你，指导到你吐出来为止。”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5588", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……安洁现在，或许站在了人生的分叉路口上！”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3601", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“果然念书还是靠自己──”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3602", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了，走吧。”", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5589", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学拎着安洁的脖子把她拖走了。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱爱爱爱爱理同学，打扫用具很寂寞、很寂寞地在呼唤安洁！”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3603", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“考试前常有的事。不用在意。”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5590", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我已经受够英文字母跟算式跟汉字了啦～”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3604", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“纱凪学姐要跟爱理一起念书吗？”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 413, "voice": "sk3451", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“比起考试结果，自己学了什么才更重要对吧！”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 422, "voice": "sn2210", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然她说的是正确的，可是不知为何，乾同学的话听起来有点空洞。", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……安洁，你还好吗？”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……感觉只要头稍微一歪，今天记住的东西就会全部流出来了。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3605", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果变成那样，就重头开始再学一次。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5591", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“──唔！”", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3606", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁顿时僵住。", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我去准备茶吧？”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3607", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "用像机器人一样僵硬的动作泡茶。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你太夸张了。毕竟用功到这种程度了，明天的考试应该没什么问题了吧。”", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5592", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果结果不是没什么问题，安洁，会被打击到爬不起来。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 401, "voice": "ag3608", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，回去后也要复习喔♪”", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 418, "voice": "ar5593", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_10.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……一点也不留情啊，濑名同学。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
